{"ID":"20240314092328-tjazx3j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092328-tjazx3j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092328-tjazx3j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155640-touc031\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155640-iyuxrqe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155640-iyuxrqe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:188,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:188\u0026#125;","title":"【白虎桂枝汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422155640-touc031","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422155640-touc031","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"温疟者，其脉如平，身无寒但热，骨节疼烦，时呕，白虎加桂枝汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155640-s2bswoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155640-s2bswoc","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白虎加桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155640-mbz3vsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155640-mbz3vsh","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母六两甘草二两（炙）石膏一斤粳米二合桂（去皮）三两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155640-n75whkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155640-n75whkv","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右锉，每五钱，水一盏半，煎至八分，去滓，温服，汗出愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155640-2jgvsnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155640-2jgvsnv","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"温疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。温疟的人呢，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脉如平（正常人），身无寒但是有热，骨节疼烦，常常会恶心，白虎加桂枝汤主之。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”这个白虎桂枝汤呢，你看，这个白虎汤加了桂枝，石膏啊，知母啊，炙甘草，粳米，加了一味桂枝在里面，这就是因为它但热，无寒！但热无寒的话一定是阳明症，你不管它是疟症，它本身是疟对不对？但是它有但热不寒，通通是属于白虎汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155640-iyuxrqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155640-iyuxrqe","updated":"20240422155640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那骨节间疼烦，常常会恶心，那这种情形呢我们白虎汤为什么加桂枝？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝就是到，主四肢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们会用到树枝，哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"树枝，就是要到四肢的末梢去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；用到花，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最高的地方就是鼻子，脑鼻的问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎类，茎类的是土，所以肠胃的问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们会用到根茎类的药物，中药就这样来的。所以我们有，比如说，桑枝、桂枝，有很多地方用到枝，就是要进入四肢上面。那像经方呢我们用的是桂枝，我们不会用到其他的树枝哦，用桂枝。"}]}]}